.TH SDL_GetSurfacePalette 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetSurfacePalette \- Get the palette used by a surface.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_surface.h>
.PP
.BI "SDL_Palette * SDL_GetSurfacePalette(SDL_Surface *surface);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I surface
the
.BR SDL_Surface
structure to query\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns a pointer to the palette used by the surface, or NULL if there is no palette used\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SDL_SetSurfacePalette (3)
